cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "GLiquid"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for fitting DFT-referenced liquid free energies from digitized equilibrium
  phase boundaries, and for interpolating multicomponent phase diagrams from the fitted binary
  liquid descriptions.
type: software
# A literal: bump `version` and `date-released` by hand at each release (CONTRIBUTING.md).
